			"notes": "✨ What's New\n\n🎵 Redesigned Music HUD\n\nNew 300 × 100 HUD card.\n\nRounded album artwork frame.\n\nDynamically scaled song titles.\n\nLive karaoke lyrics display.\n\nAnimated audio equalizer.\n\nGradient progress bar with timestamps.\n\n🎨 Website-Matched GUI\n\nSettings dashboard redesigned to match the website.\n\nConsistent lavender-and-mint glass aesthetic.\n\nUpdated buttons, sliders, and toggles.\n\nImproved visual consistency across the entire interface.\n\n🛠️ Smarter HUD Editor\n\nDrag-and-drop HUD positioning.\n\nSnap guides for easier alignment.\n\nCorner brackets for precise positioning.\n\nLive scale readout.\n\nTop and bottom position presets.\n\nAlways-visible HUD toggle.\n\n🌏 Khmer Font Rendering Fix\n\nRestored vanilla font providers.\n\nAdded Noto Sans Khmer as a fallback font.\n\nImproved Khmer text shaping and syllable rendering.\n\nLatin, Khmer, and CJK characters can now render together correctly."
		}
